WEBVTT

00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:01.101
You're one of three.

00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:04.018
You're going to up that number,
you're going to give it away.

00:07:04.042 --> 00:07:07.309
VV: Yeah, three people have dived
to the bottom of the Pacific Ocean.

00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:09.476
The USS Trieste in 1960
with two individuals.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.018
James Cameron in 2012
with his Deep Sea Challenger --

00:07:12.042 --> 00:07:13.601
thank you, Jim, great sub.

00:07:13.625 --> 00:07:15.476
This is a third-generation technology.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.476
We're not only going to try and go down,
actually in two weeks,

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.768
but we're going to try
and do it multiple times,

00:07:20.792 --> 00:07:22.393
which has never been done before.

00:07:22.417 --> 00:07:24.851
If we can do that,
we'll have proven the technology

00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:27.476
and that door will not just go open,
it will stay open.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.768
(Applause)